<title>ITALY: Italy tax revenues on target - finmin source.</title>
<headline>Italy tax revenues on target - finmin source.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's tax revenues in 1996 and early 1997 were on target, a finance ministry source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The performance of tax revenues in 1996 and in the first months of 1997 are in line with forecasts,&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
